      "Section": "Organization Career Page Settings",
      "Anchor": "organization-career-page-settings",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Organization Career Page Settings API returns the career page settings for the organization (i.e. Company, School and Showcase) data. This API doesn\u0027t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Career Page Settings",
      "Anchor": "organization-career-page-settings",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following method:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Career Page Settings",
      "Anchor": "organization-career-page-settings",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Get a career page settings for the given organization URN. Organization URN is in the format urn:li:organization:{organization id} and represents a LinkedIn Company Page.\nUse this API to find the Organization id",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
