      "Text": "How to determine which organizational pages you can query:\nTo find the organizations you can query {{resource, plural}} for, please use OrganizationAuthorization\u2019s BATCH_FIND by AuthorizationAction and AuthenticatedMember with an authorization action of CareerPageAuthorizationActionType.CAREER_PAGE_JOBS_READ.",
